  "body": "Discover Your Paradise at Hobbs Bay Estate, Gulf Harbour\r\n\r\nWelcome to Hobbs Bay Estate (Subdivision) in Gulf Harbour - a prime residential subdivision ready for your architectural masterpiece. Nestled within the exclusive new Hobbs Bay Estate, this is your rare opportunity to build the home and lifestyle you've always envisioned.\r\n\r\nThese generous parcels of land offer a fantastic opportunity to build in one of the most sought - after locations in Gulf Harbour. With a tranquil environment and stunning views, these sections are perfect for families or individuals looking to create their ideal living space.\r\n\r\nHobbs Bay Estate is conveniently located close to local amenities, including shops, cafes, restaurants schools, and recreational facilities. Enjoy easy access to beautiful beaches and scenic coastal walks, making it an ideal spot for outdoor enthusiasts. And a convenient ferry ride into Auckland City from the Gulf Harbour Marina is available around the corner.\r\n\r\nExplore our full selection of premium sites, with most lots currently available for viewing. Experience Hobbs Bay Estate firsthand. Visit us at the Hobbs Bay Estate homestead (Sales Office) this weekend on Sunday between 11:00 am to 3:00 pm to preview this exceptional subdivision.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information and to arrange a viewing. Your future home awaits!",
